Key Features
Dual-Layer Security: Google Sign-In via Firebase for identity authentication, paired with a custom 6-digit passcode for instant local unlock.

Smart Session Management: Automatically routes returning users directly to the passcode entry screen for quick and secure access.

Encrypted Storage: Stores images and videos securely using combined passcode and master-key encryption logic to protect files against unauthorized access.

Media Management: Dedicated folders for organizing private photos and video files seamlessly.

Passcode Management: Built-in option to update or change the security passcode at any time.
